       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order. Metformin 1700 mg three times daily comes to 5,100 mg/day. That is double the labeled maximum daily dose:\n\n- **Immediate-release:** maximum 2,550 mg/day, usually 850 mg three times daily with meals.\n- **Extended-release:** maximum 2,000 to 2,500 mg/day, depending on the product.\n\nA dose this high raises the risk of lactic acidosis and GI toxicity. Normal kidney and liver function doesn't change the labeled ceiling.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **1700 mg/day total**, for example 850 mg twice daily with meals.\n- **850 mg three times daily**, which is 2,550 mg/day and the IR maximum.\n- **Another dose or frequency.** Tell me what you intended.\n\nOnce you confirm a dose within the labeled limit, I'll enter it right away."
